<div class="instruction-content">
	<ul>
        <li>The commission line A, B, C and D define the commision rates offered to an agent on the following bet types: Handicap (HDP), Over/Under (OU), Odd/Even (OE) and some minor bet types such as 1st Handicap, 1st Over/Under, 1st Odd/Even, Clean Sheet, Double Change, Draw No Bet, Both/One/Neither Team to Score, To Win To Nil, 3-Way Handicap, Home No Bet, Away No Bet, Draw/No Draw, FT. 1x2 HDP, and 1st 1x2 HDP. Each line has different values for min and max commission.</li> 
        <li>1x2 Comm (%): the commission rate offered to an agent on the bet types 1st 1X2 and FT. 1X2.</li>
        <li>Other Comm (%): the commission rate offered to an agent on the other bet types such as Correct Score, Total Goal, Mix Parlay, Outright, First Goal/Last Goal, HT/FT, Moneyline, 1st Moneyline, System Parlay, and 1st Correct Score.</li>
	</ul>
</div>